<http://data.silknow.org/object/7c464c05-707b-3929-a767-3ec0d097d660>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Bustle pad of dark brown glazed calico trimmed with dark brown silk cord. It consists of an almost square pad with rounded corners overlaid with a smaller one held in place by the silk cord. \n\nIt appears to be stuffed with straw. It fastens with a white waist tape."@en , "Bought in Paris\n\nThis French rectangular bustle pad is stuffed with straw and would have provided a firm shelf-like support for the skirt and petticoats worn over it. This helped create the fashionable silhouette of the mid 1880s a period in which bustles briefly returned to favour.\n\nBustle pad\nAu Louvre\nFrance, Paris, about 1885\nGlazed calico, stuffed with straw and trimmed with silk cord\nV&A: T.377-1978 [16/04/2016-12/03/2017]"@en , "Bustle pad of glazed calico, France, ca. 1885"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/dc5d4368-8192-3a6d-a411-8148fdbf6494> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/3c09e859-d791-3982-84e1-d826122e18a1> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Bought in Paris\n\nThis French rectangular bustle pad is stuffed with straw and would have provided a firm shelf-like support for the skirt and petticoats worn over it. This helped create the fashionable silhouette of the mid 1880s a period in which bustles briefly returned to favour.\n\nBustle pad\nAu Louvre\nFrance, Paris, about 1885\nGlazed calico, stuffed with straw and trimmed with silk cord\nV&A: T.377-1978 [16/04/2016-12/03/2017]"@en , "Bustle pad of dark brown glazed calico trimmed with dark brown silk cord. It consists of an almost square pad with rounded corners overlaid with a smaller one held in place by the silk cord. \n\nIt appears to be stuffed with straw. It fastens with a white waist tape."@en , "Bustle pad of glazed calico, France, ca. 1885"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/7c464c05-707b-3929-a767-3ec0d097d660/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/7c464c05-707b-3929-a767-3ec0d097d660/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/7c464c05-707b-3929-a767-3ec0d097d660/dimension/2> ;
